{"4117700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gladiator Arena: Heroes of Rome", "steam_appid": 4117700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4931070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiator Arena: Heroes of Rome</strong> is a tactical turn based card game where deckbuilding, positioning, and smart decision making define the victor. Select a single gladiator or command a full squad, tailor your deck, and bring your best strategy into the arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arena Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into competitive duels, chaotic free-for-all clashes, or strategic team battles where coordination and precise positioning decide victory. Whether you dive into intense PvP combat, coordinate tactical co-op battles with friends, or challenge AI opponents in singleplayer, every mode can be fully customized to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gladiator Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each gladiator has a unique deck, enhanced with weapon-specific cards. Swing a sword and shield, unleash massive damage with the war axe, or strike from a distance with the spear. Adapt your deck on the fly by switching weapons mid-battle to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/5e196bb1916e2e3c652d84cca19fa63a.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/5e196bb1916e2e3c652d84cca19fa63a.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/5e196bb1916e2e3c652d84cca19fa63a.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your gladiators with move and action cards. Maneuver them into advantageous positions, anticipate enemy attacks with precise blocks, and strike where opponents least expect it. Refine your tactics, master the battlefield, and rise to become the Hero of Rome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/efba92c41ff072ffe099cc866a28e292.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/efba92c41ff072ffe099cc866a28e292.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/efba92c41ff072ffe099cc866a28e292.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stamina System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the arena, stamina is your silent enemy. Aggressive play can create powerful bursts of momentum, but overplaying cards adds fatigue cards to your deck. These block your hand and weaken future turns. Skilled players balance risk and endurance, transforming fatigue into a tactical advantage rather than a setback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/2d81426c538d1aff41e9b9d7d8ddb355.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/2d81426c538d1aff41e9b9d7d8ddb355.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/2d81426c538d1aff41e9b9d7d8ddb355.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hex-based Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike other card games that focus on attack and defense, the arena adds a dimension of positioning. Move your gladiators across the hexagonal battlefield in six directions, outmaneuver opponents, and stay just out of their reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/f47c42180ac3a7b9d65afcce43766f17.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/f47c42180ac3a7b9d65afcce43766f17.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/f47c42180ac3a7b9d65afcce43766f17.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glory favors the daring.<br>But in the arena, it belongs to the strategic.<br>Do you have what it takes to dominate the arena?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gladiator Arena: Heroes of Rome</strong> is a tactical turn based card game where deckbuilding, positioning, and smart decision making define the victor. Select a single gladiator or command a full squad, tailor your deck, and bring your best strategy into the arena.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Arena Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into competitive duels, chaotic free-for-all clashes, or strategic team battles where coordination and precise positioning decide victory. Whether you dive into intense PvP combat, coordinate tactical co-op battles with friends, or challenge AI opponents in singleplayer, every mode can be fully customized to match your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.webm?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/4d1ac4822c290f4af2c66649791aa4d5.mp4?t=1783254315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gladiator Deck</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each gladiator has a unique deck, enhanced with weapon-specific cards. Swing a sword and shield, unleash massive damage with the war axe, or strike from a distance with the spear. Adapt your deck on the fly by switching weapons mid-battle to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/5e196bb1916e2e3c652d84cca19fa63a.poster.avif?t=1783254315\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117700/extras/5e196bb1916e